#, xml-text
#~ msgid "First, apply some changes from upstream:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Primeiro, aplique algumas mudanças originárias do fluxo de desenvolvimento:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&glibc-upstream-patch;</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&glibc-upstream-patch;</userinput>"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid "Now fix an issue which may break Valgrind in BLFS:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Agora corrija um problema que possivelmente quebre o Valgrind no BLFS:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -e '/unistd.h/i #include &lt;string.h&gt;' \\\n"
#~ "    -e '/libc_rwlock_init/c\\\n"
#~ "  __libc_rwlock_define_initialized (, reset_lock);\\\n"
#~ "  memcpy (&amp;lock, &amp;reset_lock, sizeof (lock));' \\\n"
#~ "    -i stdlib/abort.c </userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -e '/unistd.h/i #include &lt;string.h&gt;' \\\n"
#~ "    -e '/libc_rwlock_init/c\\\n"
#~ "  __libc_rwlock_define_initialized (, reset_lock);\\\n"
#~ "  memcpy (&amp;lock, &amp;reset_lock, sizeof (lock));' \\\n"
#~ "    -i stdlib/abort.c </userinput>"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<emphasis>misc/tst-preadvwritev2</emphasis> and <emphasis>misc/tst-"
#~ "preadvwritev64v2</emphasis> are known to fail if the host kernel is "
#~ "Linux-6.14 or later."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<emphasis>misc/tst-preadvwritev2</emphasis> e <emphasis>misc/tst-"
#~ "preadvwritev64v2</emphasis> são conhecidos por falharem se o núcleo do "
#~ "anfitrião for Linux-6.14 ou posterior."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid "Now fix a security vulnerability:"
#~ msgstr "Agora corrija uma vulnerabilidade de segurança:"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Then use the <command>localedef</command> command to create and install "
#~ "locales not listed in the <filename>glibc-&glibc-"
#~ "version;/localedata/SUPPORTED</filename> file when you need them. For "
#~ "instance, the following two locales are needed for some tests later in this "
#~ "chapter:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Então, use o comando <command>localedef</command> para criar e instalar "
#~ "localidades não listadas no arquivo <filename>glibc-&glibc-"
#~ "version;/localedata/SUPPORTED</filename> quando você precisar delas. Por "
#~ "exemplo, as seguintes duas localidades são necessárias para alguns testes "
#~ "posteriormente neste capítulo:"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput remap=\"locale-full\">localedef -i C -f UTF-8 C.UTF-8\n"
#~ "localedef -i ja_JP -f SHIFT_JIS ja_JP.SJIS 2> /dev/null || true</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput remap=\"locale-full\">localedef -i C -f UTF-8 C.UTF-8\n"
#~ "localedef -i ja_JP -f SHIFT_JIS ja_JP.SJIS 2> /dev/null || true</userinput>"

#, no-wrap, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<userinput>rm -rfv $(dirname $(gcc -print-libgcc-file-name))/include-"
#~ "fixed/*</userinput>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<userinput>rm -rfv $(dirname $(gcc -print-libgcc-file-name))/include-"
#~ "fixed/*</userinput>"

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Three <emphasis>nptl/tst-thread-affinity*</emphasis> tests are known to "
#~ "fail."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Três testes <emphasis>nptl/tst-thread-affinity*</emphasis> são conhecidos "
#~ "por falharem."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Some tests, for example <emphasis>nss/tst-nss-files-hosts-multi</emphasis>, "
#~ "are known to fail on relatively slow systems due to an internal timeout."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Alguns testes, por exemplo <emphasis>nss/tst-nss-files-hosts-"
#~ "multi</emphasis>, são conhecidos por falharem em sistemas relativamente "
#~ "lentos devido a um de tempo limite interno."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Additionally, some tests may fail with a relatively old CPU model or host "
#~ "kernel version."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Além disso, alguns testes possivelmente falhem com um modelo de CPU ou "
#~ "versão do núcleo do anfitrião relativamente antigo."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Now fix two security vulnerabilities and a regression causing the "
#~ "posix_memalign() function very slow in some conditions:"
